# The defect classes this distribution DECLARES (mtools:W629), planted one at a time by the
# `:mutants` runner: <module>|<name>|<pattern>|<replacement>|<scope>. A line that stops
# matching is a STALE declaration and fails the grid as UNAPPLIED.

# The worst view is the minimum, named, and the trichromat is a view called trichromat.
src/mikemol/cvdcore/core.py|minimum-never-updated|if distance < best\[0\]:|if False:|def=worst_view_dE
src/mikemol/cvdcore/core.py|trichromat-left-unnamed|best = \(distance, view or _TRICHROMAT\)|best = (distance, view)|def=worst_view_dE
src/mikemol/cvdcore/core.py|surfaced-floor-differs|"surfaced": floor|"surfaced": 0.0|def=reference_floors
src/mikemol/cvdcore/core.py|severity-halved|"severity": SEVERITY|"severity": 50|def=_source
src/mikemol/cvdcore/core.py|trichromat-simulated|return "sRGB1"|return {"name": "sRGB1+CVD", "cvd_type": "protanomaly", "severity": SEVERITY}|def=_source
